---
layout: layouts/base.njk
locale: en
title: "Check RECA Eligibility | Downwinders Advocates"
description: "Check your family's eligibility for federal Radiation Exposure Compensation Act (RECA) programs. Covered counties, qualifying conditions, and claim filing support."
permalink: /check/
extraScripts: '<script src="/js/screener.js" defer></script>'
---
<section class="sec" id="check">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto">
      <p class="eyebrow">Quick &amp; Confidential Eligibility Check</p>
      <h1>See If Your Family Qualifies For Federal Compensation</h1>
      <p class="lede">Answer a few questions below. An advocate will review your information against official Department of Justice guidelines.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Ready to File Callout -->
    <div class="callout-box" style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;width:100%">
      <strong>Already know you qualify?</strong>
      <p>Checking eligibility is the exact same quick first step required if you already know you are ready to file a claim. Submitting your details allows our team to begin pulling county records and assembling your family's official file immediately.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Screener & Intake Form -->
    <div class="form-card" style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;width:100%">
      <h2 style="font-size:24px;color:var(--navy)">1. Your Contact Information</h2>
      <p class="muted">We use this to reach you with your file evaluation. We never share or sell your information.</p>

      <form id="screener" class="stack">
        <div class="form-grid-2">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="fname">First Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="fname" name="fname" autocomplete="given-name" required placeholder="Jane">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="lname">Last Name *</label>
            <input type="text" id="lname" name="lname" autocomplete="family-name" required placeholder="Doe">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid-2">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="email">Email Address *</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="jane.doe@example.com">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="phone">Phone Number *</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required placeholder="(801) 555-0123">
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin:var(--sp2) 0">

        <h2 style="font-size:24px;color:var(--navy)">2. Exposure &amp; Location Details</h2>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Where did the affected family member live or work?</legend>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="state" required><span><strong>Utah, New Mexico, or Idaho:</strong> Lived anywhere in the state</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="az"><span><strong>Arizona:</strong> Coconino, Yavapai, Navajo, Apache, Gila, or Mohave County</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="nv"><span><strong>Nevada:</strong> Eureka, Lander, Lincoln, Nye, White Pine, or designated Clark County</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="uranium"><span><strong>Uranium Industry:</strong> Mined, milled, or transported uranium ore</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="onsite"><span><strong>On-Site Participant:</strong> Present at atmospheric nuclear tests or test sites</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="mpw"><span><strong>Manhattan Project Waste:</strong> Qualifying communities in MO, TN, KY, or AK</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="place" value="dunno"><span>I am not sure of the exact county / need help checking</span></label>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Estimated timeframe of residency or employment:</legend>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="years" value="ok" required><span>At least one year between <strong>January 1951 and November 1962</strong></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="years" value="oknm"><span><strong>New Mexico:</strong> At least one year between September 1944 and November 1962</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="years" value="okjuly"><span>Present for the <strong>entire month of July 1962</strong></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="years" value="uranium"><span>Uranium employment between 1942 and 1971</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="years" value="dunno"><span>I am not sure of the exact dates</span></label>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Who is filing this claim?</legend>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="who" value="self" required><span><strong>The person who was exposed</strong> (filing for myself)</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="who" value="survivor"><span><strong>Surviving family member:</strong> Spouse, child, grandchild, or parent of deceased</span></label>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="notes">Briefly describe the illness / diagnosis or family notes (Optional):</label>
          <textarea id="notes" name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="E.g., My father was diagnosed with lung cancer in 1988 after living in Washington County, UT..."></textarea>
        </div>

        <button class="btn" type="submit" style="align-self:flex-start;font-size:18px;padding:16px 36px">Submit My Eligibility Request &rarr;</button>
        <div class="result" id="out" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <!-- Clean 3-Column / 3-Bullet List of Covered Cancers & Conditions (No Dropdowns) -->
    <div class="cancers-overview" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp4) auto 0;width:100%">
      <div class="cancers-overview-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Medical Eligibility Criteria</span>
        <h2>Covered Conditions by Program</h2>
        <p class="muted">RECA explicitly covers specific primary cancers and chronic respiratory/renal conditions established by federal law:</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cancers-cols">
        <!-- Col 1: Downwinders -->
        <div class="cancer-col-card">
          <h4>Downwinders (19 Primary Cancers)</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Leukemia (non-chronic lymphocytic)</li>
            <li>Multiple Myeloma</li>
            <li>Lymphomas (other than Hodgkin's)</li>
            <li>Thyroid &amp; Female/Male Breast</li>
            <li>Lung, Colon &amp; Stomach</li>
            <li>Pancreas &amp; Liver (non-cirrhotic)</li>
            <li>Brain &amp; Salivary Gland</li>
            <li>Urinary Bladder &amp; Kidney</li>
            <li>Ovary &amp; Esophagus</li>
            <li>Pharynx, Small Intestine, Bile Ducts &amp; Gall Bladder</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Col 2: Uranium Workers -->
        <div class="cancer-col-card">
          <h4>Uranium Workers (7 Conditions)</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Primary Lung Cancer</li>
            <li>Pulmonary Fibrosis</li>
            <li>Cor Pulmonale (related to fibrosis)</li>
            <li>Silicosis</li>
            <li>Pneumoconiosis</li>
            <li>Renal (Kidney) Cancer</li>
            <li>Chronic Renal Disease (including nephritis and tubal tissue injury)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Col 3: Manhattan Project Waste -->
        <div class="cancer-col-card">
          <h4>Manhattan Waste &amp; On-Site</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Bone Cancer &amp; Renal Cancer</li>
            <li>Leukemia &amp; Lymphomas</li>
            <li>Primary Thyroid &amp; Breast Cancer</li>
            <li>GI Tract &amp; Respiratory Cancers</li>
            <li>On-Site Atmospheric Exposure Conditions</li>
            <li>Reimbursement of Related Medical Expenses</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Explainer Video Section -->
    <div class="consultation-card" style="max-width:860px;margin:var(--sp4) auto 0;width:100%;text-align:left;align-items:flex-start">
      <h3 style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:24px">Why We Need You To Fill Out This Form</h3>
      <p style="max-width:100%">
        Preparing an approved RECA claim requires satisfying three strict statutory pillars: <strong>qualifying location</strong>, <strong>verified dates of presence</strong>, and a <strong>qualifying medical pathology or death certificate</strong>.
      </p>
      <div style="background:rgba(0,0,0,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;width:100%;margin:8px 0">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center">
          <div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;color:#3A2606">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;display:block">Watch: The Claims Assembly Process Explained</strong>
            <span style="color:#CBD8E6;font-size:14px">Our intake team explains how your form information enables us to track down decades-old historical records.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:15px;color:#CBD8E6">
        When you submit your details, an advocate pulls county property records, historical school yearbooks, census files, and medical records on your family's behalf so you don't have to navigate federal bureaucracy alone.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
